 "remarks": "A storybook Cape Cod on a quiet cul-de-sac, a beautiful, level half-acre property, and an unbeatable Westport location-3 Allen Lane is a rare opportunity to make a home your own! Brimming with classic New England charm and possibilities, this inviting home offers the flexibility to move right in, thoughtfully update over time, or expand to suit your vision. One of its standout features is a desirable floor plan with all three bedrooms together on the second floor, an uncommon and welcome feature in a traditional Cape Cod. Two full bathrooms, a half bath, and a finished lower level, perfect for a playroom, recreation room, home office, or gym, add to the home's versatility. The expansive, level .54-acre property offers exciting potential for future expansion, including the possibility of adding a first-floor primary suite, subject to town approvals. Public water and sewer are additional advantages. And the location is exceptional! Tucked away in a peaceful neighborhood setting yet just minutes to downtown Westport, both the Westport and Greens Farms Metro-North train stations, schools, shopping, restaurants, and Compo Beach, everything that makes Westport such a desirable place to call home is close at hand. Whether you choose to embrace its timeless charm or transform it into the home you've always envisioned, 3 Allen Lane offers an increasingly hard-to-find combination of location, land, character, and potential. An opportunity not to be missed!",
